---
import LogoMark from './LogoMark.astro';
import { PROJECT_NAME, STATUS_DATE, buildDay, formatDay } from '../../data/site/project';
import { footerGroups } from '../../data/site/nav';

// The footer in four groups (F44, plano 2.6): the project, the service, the free tools and how to
// reach someone. The date says what it is (plano 1.6): the day this version of the site was built,
// and apart from it the day the state of the parts was last checked.
const built = buildDay();
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <p class="footer-brand"><LogoMark /><span>{PROJECT_NAME}</span></p>
    <p class="footer-motto">Um degrau de cada vez. Tudo à vista.</p>
    <nav class="footer-columns" aria-label="Rodapé">
      {footerGroups(Astro.site).map(g => (
        <div><h2>{g.title}</h2><ul>{g.links.map(l => <li><a href={l.href} data-hit-link={l.hit}>{l.label}</a></li>)}</ul></div>
      ))}
    </nav>
    <p class="footer-privacy">Projeto sem fins lucrativos, ainda sem registro formal. Quando tiver, o número aparece aqui. Contamos visitas sem guardar IP. A conversa com a Yume fica guardada por até 180 dias pra melhorar o site. Não mande nome nem contato.</p>
    <p class="footer-note">Esta versão do site é de <time datetime={built}>{formatDay(built)}</time>. Estado das partes conferido em <time datetime={STATUS_DATE}>{formatDay(STATUS_DATE)}</time>.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
